<p><b>Vista objects</b> are large, low-detail props that are placed far outside the player-accessible area of a level layout to create a sense of scale that's much larger than the level would otherwise allow. For example, one can place mountains on the horizon.
</p><p>For scale, the green terrain mesh visible in each shot is a default 64m x 64m size
</p>
